{"id":"n62101-1-8","stage":1,"title":"즐겁다 · 愉快","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62101-1-8-1","ko":"내일부터 일주일 동안 잠깐 제주도에 여행을 갈 거예요.","zh":"从明天开始，我要去济州岛旅行一个星期。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일부터","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일주일","meaning":"一周，一星期","explanation":"일주일：一周，一星期","readings":[{"term":"일주일","audio":"/audio/d7137afeb52708a5fcb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30189","senseId":"1","lemma":"일주일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동안","meaning":"期间","explanation":"동안：期间","readings":[{"term":"동안","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70749","senseId":"1","lemma":"동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잠깐","meaning":"暂时，一会儿，片刻","explanation":"잠깐：暂时，一会儿，片刻","readings":[{"term":"잠깐","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57312","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠깐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제주도에","meaning":"济州岛","explanation":"제주도：济州岛；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"제주도에","audio":"/audio/a56332c57b721e11f8a6.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"여행을","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"d7137afeb52708a5","term":"일주일","zh":"一周，一星期","audio":"/audio/d7137afeb52708a5fcb9.mp3","entryId":"30189","definition":"从周一开始到周日的七天；或指一周。","pronunciation":["일쭈일"]},{"id":"2aa02e1d6b86b37d","term":"동안","zh":"期间","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3","entryId":"70749","definition":"从某一时期另一时期之间的时间长度。","pronunciation":["동안"]},{"id":"4e073566099677ea","term":"잠깐","zh":"暂时，一会儿，片刻","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3","entryId":"57312","definition":"非常短的时间。","pronunciation":["잠깐"]},{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/0590fd2c551ce559dac9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62101-1-8-2","ko":"좋으시겠네요. 즐거운 여행이 되기를 바라요.","zh":"真不错啊。祝你旅途愉快。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋으시겠네요.","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"즐거운","meaning":"愉快，欢乐，欢快","explanation":"즐겁다：愉快，欢乐，欢快；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"즐겁다","audio":"/audio/71ab7f4d89daedabda61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62101","senseId":"1","lemma":"즐겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여행이","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되기를","meaning":"顺利，不错","explanation":"되다：顺利，不错；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바라요.","meaning":"期待，盼望","explanation":"바라다：期待，盼望；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"바라다","audio":"/audio/527140f180313dac73f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58156","senseId":"1","lemma":"바라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"71ab7f4d89daedab","term":"즐겁다","zh":"愉快，欢乐，欢快","audio":"/audio/71ab7f4d89daedabda61.mp3","entryId":"62101","definition":"内心满意、满足且快乐。","pronunciation":["즐겁따"]},{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"顺利，不错","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"事情发展得很好。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"527140f180313dac","term":"바라다","zh":"期待，盼望","audio":"/audio/527140f180313dac73f4.mp3","entryId":"58156","definition":"希望事情按照某种想法或愿望得以实现。","pronunciation":["바라다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a2ac70284a39f7122b70.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.36,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62101","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":39,"sequenceScore":1.7388,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["从明天开始，我要去济州岛旅行一个星期。","真不错啊。祝你旅途愉快。","我终于通过考试了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["从明天开始，我要去济州岛旅行一个星期。","真不错啊。祝你旅途愉快。","我终于通过考试了。"],"answer":1}]}
